    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90057.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Welcome to the very best part of my broadcast week. I'm Adrian Garrett, host and creator of this amazing program known as The Takeout, where each and every week dear audience you know this, but just to remind you two things. What are those two things? We're letlessly curious, steadfastly non-ideological, and as you have noticed, no doubt, still working from home. For those of you who are not, for those of you who are on the front lines, we wish you all the best. Stay safe. Know that we rely on you and we appreciate you. The rest of us are staying at home, working from home, trying to keep on the right side of this continuing COVID-19 curve. In some states that's going well, in some states that's going in the opposite direction. Our guests this week, Senator Joe Manchin, Democrat from West Virginia, Senator Manchin, great to see you. You're working from your office and the Senate Heart Office Building. It's great to see you virtually and great to talk to you.",
