    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "That's why I voted for it. And I thought it was time that we do. And I've always said this major. If I can't explain it back home in West Virginia, I can't vote for it. I couldn't explain not voting to get on the bill, because I'm not sure if that bill is going to come back. I don't know if it's a high priority for Mitch McConnell, who sets the agenda. And that's what I was concerned about. So I thought we better take advantage of the time. And I didn't want the perfect to be the defeat of the good.",
