    "turn_text": "So I wonder, two questions. In your state, has there been this quote unquote backlash against facial coverings, mask like you're suppressing my rights to my own liberty? Have you had that sort of debate? And when you talk in that blunt way about the importance of all these mechanisms, social distancing, mask wearing, and the like, how do you phrase it back home?",
